+2. look in that cut-out for a **hand**: skin-coloured parts that come in from the photo edge, plus other parts reaching the edge (sleeve, arm) or a second separate object;
+3. if found, place Keep points on the object, Remove points on the hand / sleeve and a box around the object, and let SAM 2 cut the object out;
